#. module: contract_tier_validation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:contract_tier_validation.field_res_company__contract_lock_lines_after_validation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:contract_tier_validation.field_res_config_settings__contract_lock_lines_after_validation
msgid ""
"Once a contract has passed its validation, stop its lines from being added, "
"removed or edited, so the terms that were approved are the terms that run. "
"The invoicing run and the renewal actions keep working. Turn this off for "
"companies that amend running contracts instead of re-approving them."
msgstr ""
"Una vez validado un contrato, impide añadir, eliminar o modificar sus "
"líneas, de modo que las condiciones aprobadas sean las que se aplican. La "
"facturación y las acciones de renovación siguen funcionando. Desactívelo en "
"las compañías que modifican contratos en curso en lugar de volver a "
"aprobarlos."

#. module: contract_tier_validation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:contract_tier_validation.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Once a contract has passed its validation, stop its lines from being added, "
"removed or edited. The invoicing run and the renewal actions keep working."
msgstr ""
"Una vez validado un contrato, impide añadir, eliminar o modificar sus "
"líneas. La facturación y las acciones de renovación siguen funcionando."

